","s":0,"q":"second half of the year has started strongly with performance in line with recently upgraded expectations"},{"d":"2024-09-24","doc":"R","fy":"FY24","g":"flat","s":0,"q":"Strong trading momentum continues with significant growth in key markets"},{"d":"2024-11-19","doc":"AGM","fy":"FY25","g":"flat","s":0,"q":"positive start to the financial year, in line with expectations"},{"d":"2025-03-18","doc":"H1 R","fy":"FY25","g":"flat","s":-1,"q":"The Board anticipates a stronger H2 weighting than usual periods, driven by our growing client base … This supports our confidence in meeting market expectations for FY25"},{"d":"2025-09-23","doc":"R","fy":"FY25","g":"flat","s":0,"q":"Delivered earnings growth in line with expectations while laying strong foundations for the next phase of expansion"},{"d":"2025-11-13","doc":"AGM","fy":"FY26","g":"flat","s":0,"q":"trade in line with management expectations for the financial year"},{"d":"2026-01-22","doc":"H1 TU","fy":"FY26","g":"flat","s":0,"q":"positive trading momentum and the strongest trading run-rate to date from its existing client base, alongside excellent progress in international markets"},{"d":"2026-03-17","doc":"H1 R","fy":"FY26","g":"flat","s":0,"q":"Board remains confident in meeting expectations for the full year and in the Group's long-term growth strategy … any downside impact [from UK gaming tax, &lt;6% of GP] is expected to be absorbed within the broader growth trajectory"},{"d":"2026-07-23","doc":"FY TU","fy":"FY26","g":"RAISE","s":2,"q":"Gross profit and adjusted EBITDA in FY26 have grown slightly ahead of market expectations … With five international markets now live, piloting or in build, and an accelerating product roadmap, the Group is building strong momentum for future growth, and the Board looks to FY27 with real confidence."},{"d":"2026-09-22","doc":"R","fy":"FY26","g":"RAISE","s":2,"q":"Delivered a return to double-digit growth in gross profit and adjusted EBITDA, slightly ahead of market expectations … Fonix enters FY27 with real momentum … Six markets, multiple products, one platform: I have never been more confident in Fonix's ability to deliver its next phase of growth."},{"d":"2026-11-18","doc":"AGM","fy":"FY27","g":"flat","s":0,"q":"Fonix has made a positive start to the financial year and is trading in line with management expectations. Momentum in the UK is strong, and the Group's international and product expansion strategy continues to progress."}]}